0011;4;Q105243579;Mimiko Hasaba (枷場 美々子, Hasaba Mimiko) is the twin sister of Nanako. She always carries a cursed doll around, which is involved with her technique. She cares deeply for Geto and is extremely angry at Kenjaku for taking over his body. Sukuna kills her in the events of the Shibuya Incident. Her death, along with many other innocent civilians, traumatized Yuji.
